flowchart TD
    A[Customer Cart / Order] --> B[Authenticated Customer payment initiation]
    B --> C[Backend loads Order total + BDT from MongoDB]
    C --> D[Create PaymentAttempt + unique tran_id]
    D --> E[Server POST Create Session to SSLCOMMERZ Sandbox]
    E --> F[HTTPS GatewayPageURL]
    F --> G[Customer pays on SSLCOMMERZ hosted page]
    G --> H[IPN / Success / Fail / Cancel callback]
    H --> I[Find PaymentAttempt by tran_id]
    I --> J[Server calls Validation API / Transaction Query API]
    J --> K{Verified transaction + amount + BDT + refs?}
    K -- No --> L[failed / invalid / pending / risk_hold]
    K -- Yes --> M{risk_level = 1?}
    M -- Yes --> N[risk_hold; Order payment pending; no fulfilment]
    M -- No --> O[MongoDB transaction]
    O --> P[PaymentAttempt verified_paid]
    O --> Q[Order paymentStatus paid + paidAt]
    Q --> R[Restaurant Admin may advance fulfilment]
    H -. browser return only .-> S[Customer Orders page status banner]
    S --> T[Customer can explicitly reconcile pending payment]
    T --> J
